> [@notonlybytes](https://github.com/notonlybytes) I don't have that problem. It also works for me with version 1.17.3 which is what the `latest` tag currently returns. Maybe you're using a locally cached version of the image, given that you use the `latest` tag (which can as well be kind of the oldest, depending on your cache)? I suggest to pull the latest version (`docker pull ghcr.io/anomalyco/opencode:latest`) and try again.

@mgoltzsche thanks for cross checking.

